{"speciesId":545,"names":{"fr":"Brutapode","es":"Scolipede","en":"Scolipede","ja":"ペンドラー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il accule l’ennemi par ses mouvements rapides et l’attaque avec ses cornes. Il ne s’arrête qu’au coup de grâce."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"With quick movements, it chases down its foes, attacking relentlessly with its horns until it prevails."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il inocule du poison à ses ennemis par les griffes de son cou. Il est extrêmement agressif."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Highly aggressive, it uses the claws near its neck to dig into its opponents and poison them."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il paralyse l’ennemi avec les griffes de son cou avant de mettre fin au combat grâce à son poison virulent."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Atenaza a sus presas con las garras que sobresalen de su cuello hasta que no se pueden mover y las remata con veneno."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"獲物を 首のツメで 挟みこみ 身動きを とれなくしてから 猛毒を 与え とどめを 刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il accule l’ennemi par ses mouvements rapides et l’attaque avec ses cornes. Il ne s’arrête qu’au coup de grâce."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Arrincona a sus rivales con rápidos movimientos y los ensarta con sus cuernos. No se detiene hasta vencer."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"With quick movements, it chases down its foes, attacking relentlessly with its horns until it prevails."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"素早い 動きで 敵を 追いつめ 頭の ツノで 攻撃する。 とどめを 刺すまで 容赦しない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il paralyse l’ennemi avec les griffes de son cou avant de mettre fin au combat grâce à son poison virulent."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Atenaza a sus presas con las garras que sobresalen de su cuello hasta que no se pueden mover y las remata con veneno."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"獲物を 首のツメで 挟みこみ 身動きを とれなくしてから 猛毒を 与え とどめを 刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il accule l’ennemi par ses mouvements rapides et l’attaque avec ses cornes. Il ne s’arrête qu’au coup de grâce."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Arrincona a sus rivales con rápidos movimientos y los ensarta con sus cuernos. No se detiene hasta vencer."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"With quick movements, it chases down its foes, attacking relentlessly with its horns until it prevails."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"素早い 動きで 敵を 追いつめ 頭の ツノで 攻撃する。 とどめを 刺すまで 容赦しない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Après avoir saisi sa proie à l’aide des griffes de son cou, il la plaque au sol puis la transperce avec ses épines empoisonnées."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Usa las garras que le sobresalen del cuello para atrapar a su presa, golpearla contra el suelo y rematarla inoculando un potente veneno."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Scolipede latches on to its prey with the claws on its neck before slamming them into the ground and jabbing them with its claws’ toxic spikes."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"首のツメで 獲物を つかむと そのまま 地面に 叩きつけ 毒のトゲを 突きたてるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il défend son territoire avec acharnement contre son ennemi Scol